 bool fragile = false;  // Cassi or Issac: losing either loses both.
 
+// Danger counts the enemies together: a lone shooter seldom bursts 30% of our health, but two or three reaching the same
+// tile do. rz12 on the fresh batch b19 (teams 34-60, to r1000, decoded): a single ranged hit on our melee champions took
+// 11% of their max health on average (63% of the hits under 10%), so no rival shooter alone marked danger and our
+// champions worked on inside their reach; hit from beyond their own reach they were 20.8 times per game (the rivals
+// 10.8) and died within 10 rounds after 24% of those (11%), 34% with three or more enemies within 6 (17%).
 bool in_danger(vec2 t) {
